WEBVTT

00:05.964 --> 00:08.341
[opening theme music playing]

00:35.035 --> 00:35.910
[sighs]

00:37.245 --> 00:39.664
What kind of madness is this, huh?

00:39.748 --> 00:43.043
Killing Mu-deok then reviving her?
Is that something to speculate?

00:43.126 --> 00:44.961
That foolish girl.

00:45.045 --> 00:47.589
I could not even stop them
since she volunteered.

00:48.089 --> 00:49.007
[sighs]

00:49.090 --> 00:50.008
That girl…

00:52.761 --> 00:54.053
was actually smiling.

00:54.137 --> 00:56.097
Yes. I will try to do it.

01:01.603 --> 01:03.396
[Heo Yeom] That childish fool!

01:03.480 --> 01:06.900
I bet she was just happy to hear that
she would get 100 yang in gold.

01:06.983 --> 01:09.110
Do you really think it was the gold…

01:11.529 --> 01:13.615
that made that girl smile like that?

01:25.710 --> 01:27.962
I do not like this situation either.

01:29.047 --> 01:31.299
So I will let you die now, painlessly.

01:31.382 --> 01:33.802
Everyone's gathered here
to see me brought back to life,

01:34.886 --> 01:37.055
not to see me die. So, please!

01:39.307 --> 01:43.645
They seem to be plotting to reveal
your true identity by stalling for time.

01:44.312 --> 01:47.232
After that girl dies,
intercept the power of the ice stone

01:47.315 --> 01:50.443
and shift your soul
into So-i's body right away.

01:50.527 --> 01:54.197
If the Queen dies here now,
we'll be able to end this meeting.

01:54.280 --> 01:55.115
[chuckles softly]

01:55.198 --> 01:59.244
We will leave Songrim
with the ice stone without trouble.

02:01.871 --> 02:04.749
Why do you think His Majesty
chose that girl?

02:05.458 --> 02:08.253
She's the weakest person here
without a doubt.

02:08.336 --> 02:09.963
It was an easy choice.

02:10.046 --> 02:12.048
[suspenseful music playing]

02:18.471 --> 02:20.473
[wind whooshing]

02:48.710 --> 02:49.711
[grunts]

02:52.839 --> 02:54.757
[thrilling music playing]

03:18.114 --> 03:19.157
So pretty!

03:20.575 --> 03:22.368
My dear Bu-yeon.

03:31.210 --> 03:32.337
Oh, Mother.

03:35.298 --> 03:37.300
[somber music playing]

03:56.444 --> 03:58.529
[celestial music playing]

04:02.492 --> 04:04.869
Yes, Your Majesty, you can do this.

04:04.953 --> 04:07.455
Keep using that power to shift your soul.

04:07.538 --> 04:09.082
[queen] I'm not doing anything.

04:09.165 --> 04:12.585
The one moving the ice stone
is not actually me.

04:12.669 --> 04:13.503
Then who is?

04:14.629 --> 04:16.631
[suspenseful music playing]

04:19.884 --> 04:21.594
[thunder rumbles]

04:22.762 --> 04:24.639
[wind howls]

04:26.266 --> 04:28.351
[thunder rumbling]

04:45.368 --> 04:47.370
[suspenseful music playing]

05:00.341 --> 05:01.634
You have to stop it now.

05:07.390 --> 05:08.308
[whimpers]

05:13.396 --> 05:16.566
Mother, Mother, are you okay?

05:20.028 --> 05:21.112
Bu-yeon.

05:25.158 --> 05:27.702
[So-i] Did she know? She must know!

05:28.286 --> 05:30.204
They're going to revive Mu-deok with that.

05:30.288 --> 05:32.123
They can't. She must die.

05:32.206 --> 05:33.082
[yells]

05:33.624 --> 05:35.710
[wind howling]

05:50.975 --> 05:52.977
[suspenseful music continues playing]

06:10.953 --> 06:11.788
[exhales]

06:19.170 --> 06:20.296
What did you do?

06:20.880 --> 06:22.590
Where did you hide the ice stone?

06:23.466 --> 06:25.259
[exhales, gasps]

06:26.469 --> 06:27.595
What just happened?

06:40.316 --> 06:41.567
[Heo Yeom] Did you see that?

06:41.651 --> 06:44.821
The ice stone's energy touched
the energy of the sky.

06:44.904 --> 06:47.990
After that, the sky took away
the ice stone.

06:49.075 --> 06:50.618
It hasn't disappeared.

06:55.289 --> 06:56.457
It is…

06:57.416 --> 06:58.501
still here.

06:58.584 --> 06:59.710
Over there?

06:59.794 --> 07:02.505
[stammers]
Where? I don't see it.

07:20.731 --> 07:22.733
[light music playing]

07:28.030 --> 07:30.116
[Go Won]
First, sudden thunder and lightning,

07:30.199 --> 07:32.243
and now, fog in the middle of the day?

07:32.326 --> 07:33.953
It's not just the fog.

07:34.036 --> 07:35.413
Something has gone wrong.

07:42.712 --> 07:45.339
- While I was unconscious?
- Yes.

07:45.423 --> 07:46.591
Is something wrong with the ice stone?

07:48.009 --> 07:49.469
[Beom] Is this a dream?

07:49.552 --> 07:52.638
- There are flowers everywhere.
- [Hyo] This doesn't feel real.

07:52.722 --> 07:55.349
Are we dead right now? Is this heaven?

07:57.477 --> 07:58.436
Hey, hey!

07:58.519 --> 08:00.146
[Go Won] Enough of nonsense.

08:00.229 --> 08:02.440
If we are in heaven,
am I the Great Jade Emperor right now,

08:02.523 --> 08:03.608
he's an angel?

08:03.691 --> 08:06.360
Huh? An angel?

08:13.075 --> 08:15.203
[whimsical music playing]

08:16.329 --> 08:17.371
What is that?

08:18.498 --> 08:19.957
I don't think it's an angel at least.

08:20.833 --> 08:22.001
Maybe a ghost?

08:31.135 --> 08:33.679
[Yun-ok] Are you all mages?

08:34.388 --> 08:36.641
Yes, we are mages of Jeongjingak.

08:37.475 --> 08:38.309
[sighs in relief]

08:40.645 --> 08:42.021
So you were here, too, Young Lady?

08:46.317 --> 08:47.568
Will you let go of me?

08:50.029 --> 08:53.783
Um, Jang Uk,
don't go anywhere and guard this place.

08:54.575 --> 08:55.826
[stammers] You.

08:56.619 --> 08:57.620
Go there.

08:57.703 --> 09:00.915
- I will go to the Training Center.
- [mage] Royal Highness, we'll go with you.

09:04.126 --> 09:05.336
What is going on now?

09:05.962 --> 09:07.213
What was with the thunder?

09:07.296 --> 09:10.132
Unfortunately, we do not know
what is going on yet, either.

09:10.216 --> 09:13.219
I am sure we'll know once the fog clears.

09:13.886 --> 09:15.638
If we are in neither heaven nor hell,

09:15.721 --> 09:17.848
the flowers blooming makes no sense.

09:19.183 --> 09:20.768
[Jang Uk] Do you really think this is fog?

09:20.851 --> 09:23.354
[mysterious music playing]

09:52.592 --> 09:53.426
[mages grunt]

09:56.721 --> 09:58.180
What the hell are you guys doing, huh?

09:58.264 --> 10:00.641
Sorry, Royal Highness.
When we approached the door,

10:00.725 --> 10:02.727
we were pushed back by
a great force of wind all of a sudden.

10:02.810 --> 10:03.936
Wind?

10:05.313 --> 10:06.564
I don't see any wind around here.

10:10.234 --> 10:12.486
Don't go any further.
You cannot really see it,

10:12.570 --> 10:14.447
but it's true a great force
is blocking the way.

10:14.530 --> 10:16.782
What on earth is really going on now?

10:16.866 --> 10:17.825
It's a barrier.

10:19.327 --> 10:21.954
It seems a great barrier
is surrounding Jeongjingak.

10:23.080 --> 10:24.040
A barrier?

10:24.123 --> 10:25.625
Who would put up a barrier right here?

10:25.708 --> 10:26.876
[Beom] Your Highness.

10:28.336 --> 10:29.795
[pants] Your Highness.

10:30.421 --> 10:33.341
A priestess of Jinyowon
is inside Jeongjingak.

10:33.424 --> 10:35.176
We found Jin Bu-yeon of Jinyowon,

10:35.259 --> 10:37.553
who brought the ice stone,
collapsed on the ground.

10:39.347 --> 10:41.599
[dramatic music playing]

10:48.939 --> 10:49.774
Mu-deok.

11:06.123 --> 11:09.794
Energy generated by the ice stone
lingered around Jeongjingak

11:09.877 --> 11:11.879
and has become a barrier.

11:13.339 --> 11:15.758
Who is inside Jeongjingak as of now?

11:16.676 --> 11:18.386
Jang Uk and Seo Yul are absent.

11:18.469 --> 11:19.720
It seems like they are in there.

11:20.930 --> 11:22.515
Young Lady Heo is also in there.

11:22.598 --> 11:24.100
My dear Yun-ok!

11:24.183 --> 11:26.727
His Royal Highness
is also trapped inside the barrier.

11:27.395 --> 11:28.229
What?

11:28.312 --> 11:30.940
[male mage 1] My dear Beom!
Is my son also in there?

11:31.023 --> 11:32.566
[male mage 2] Where is my son, Jin-ho?

11:34.110 --> 11:36.404
Lady Jin, you must do something.

11:36.487 --> 11:39.698
Your daughter who was swept off
by the ice stone must also be in there.

11:40.324 --> 11:42.326
We must not touch the barrier.

11:42.410 --> 11:46.455
We all witnessed how this happened
when Jin Bu-yeon touched the ice stone.

11:47.081 --> 11:49.834
Jinyowon has caused all this
by using the ice stone.

11:51.293 --> 11:53.254
You asked me to show you its power,

11:53.921 --> 11:55.714
and now you are placing the blame on me?

11:55.798 --> 11:56.674
[scoffs]

11:56.757 --> 11:58.717
Are you really going to start fighting?

11:59.385 --> 12:02.054
Stop that now!
Our dear children are in there!

12:02.138 --> 12:03.722
[Heo Yeom screams]
Yun-ok!

12:04.515 --> 12:06.517
[tense music playing]

12:20.906 --> 12:23.159
[Go Won] Does the sudden barrier
around Jeongjingak

12:23.242 --> 12:25.453
have anything to do with you,
the priestess, being here?

12:26.078 --> 12:27.872
What really happened
at the Training Center?

12:28.706 --> 12:30.040
[exhales] Well…

12:39.967 --> 12:41.886
[So-i] This is all happening
because of Mu-deok.

12:42.386 --> 12:45.764
Because she is
the real priestess, Jin Bu-yeon.

12:45.848 --> 12:49.643
But I cannot tell everyone
because they think I am her.

12:50.686 --> 12:51.937
What do I do?
[sighs]

12:52.521 --> 12:53.856
I asked you a question, priestess.

12:53.939 --> 12:55.107
I don't…

12:56.692 --> 12:57.985
I don't know.

12:58.068 --> 13:00.738
I have no idea
what happened since I can't see.

13:01.405 --> 13:04.158
There was a sudden gust of wind.
I fainted, then woke up here.

13:04.241 --> 13:06.160
You don't even know
how you actually got here?

13:06.243 --> 13:08.704
How could I know how I got to this place

13:08.787 --> 13:11.582
if I don't even have
any idea of where I am?

13:11.665 --> 13:12.541
[exhales]

13:16.003 --> 13:18.756
Young Lady Jin Bu-yeon does not look
very well.

13:19.256 --> 13:21.926
She is very pale and
she's sweating a lot as well.

13:22.009 --> 13:23.302
[Mu-deok] How does she look to you?

13:25.471 --> 13:28.224
Perhaps you could question her
after she rests.

13:29.308 --> 13:30.184
[exhales]

13:31.685 --> 13:32.686
All right, let her rest.

13:34.021 --> 13:34.939
Come.

13:40.653 --> 13:41.946
She is likely lying.

13:43.531 --> 13:44.698
What is she hiding?

13:44.782 --> 13:46.158
Not sure. Mu-deok must know.

13:46.992 --> 13:48.577
Mu-deok, were you with So-i?

13:51.205 --> 13:52.873
How come you're here in Jeongjingak?

13:54.124 --> 13:56.794
I was already here in the first place.

14:00.172 --> 14:01.006
You were already here?

14:02.132 --> 14:04.510
I thought you were serving tea
at the Training Center.

14:05.469 --> 14:08.889
I followed you here to Jeongjingak
as soon as I was done serving tea.

14:08.973 --> 14:11.976
I don't know what happened
at the Training Center.

14:12.935 --> 14:16.438
There's absolutely no point
in asking a servant such as her

14:16.522 --> 14:20.234
who only knows how to follow
her master around like a little puppy.

14:20.317 --> 14:21.527
[Hyo] You don't need to worry.

14:22.361 --> 14:24.822
The very best mages of Daeho are all
gathered around here.

14:24.905 --> 14:27.283
They will break this barrier
sooner or later.

14:28.450 --> 14:30.286
Go and bring some tea
for His Royal Highness.

14:30.369 --> 14:31.287
Oh, yes.

14:39.169 --> 14:40.004
[sighs]

14:43.924 --> 14:46.844
"A servant who only knows
how to follow her master around

14:47.428 --> 14:49.054
like a lost little puppy dog."

14:50.931 --> 14:52.349
That's how Mu-deok is.

14:59.023 --> 15:00.316
Oh, dear!

15:00.399 --> 15:01.984
There is no water to boil.

15:04.278 --> 15:05.112
[chuckles]

15:12.453 --> 15:14.455
[light music playing]

16:01.794 --> 16:04.213
As always,
tea made with magic tastes best.

16:06.548 --> 16:07.800
It's been forever.

16:10.511 --> 16:12.429
[Mu-deok] My energy finally returned

16:13.347 --> 16:14.848
inside the ice stone.

16:24.149 --> 16:26.819
What's this? Where am I?

16:28.570 --> 16:30.864
[young Bu-yeon] It was not
taken from us this time.

16:31.699 --> 16:33.701
We are inside the ice stone.

16:35.327 --> 16:36.745
[Mu-deok] This is the ice stone?

16:37.788 --> 16:40.958
Because it's not bound to a shape or size,

16:41.583 --> 16:42.626
and can become…

16:43.877 --> 16:46.213
water, fire, or wind.

16:49.717 --> 16:52.011
Then, you mean
the ice stone is mine right now?

16:59.018 --> 17:01.437
[Mu-deok's soul] No one can be
the master of the ice stone.

17:02.980 --> 17:05.065
You can only borrow its power.

17:05.149 --> 17:07.776
When something is pulled,
something is pushed.

17:07.860 --> 17:09.903
When something is gained,
something is lost.

17:09.987 --> 17:12.948
That is the burden of the person
who uses its power.

17:13.032 --> 17:15.534
I'm more than willing to bear as much.

17:15.617 --> 17:16.785
[Mu-deok's soul] Go ahead, then.

17:17.286 --> 17:19.329
An overflowing spirit

17:19.955 --> 17:22.666
is not something you can just discard
after you're done with it.

17:23.459 --> 17:26.211
Just as you can't avoid floods
after wanting rain.

17:26.837 --> 17:29.548
Or avoid typhoons if you want wind.

17:30.507 --> 17:31.592
You must bear it.

17:32.092 --> 17:33.135
Who are you?

17:33.886 --> 17:35.512
Are you the relic of Jinyowon?

17:36.430 --> 17:38.849
How can you call me a relic
when you are the one

17:39.767 --> 17:41.226
living off this body?

17:44.021 --> 17:45.939
[epic music playing]

18:09.963 --> 18:11.131
Jeongjingak?

18:17.471 --> 18:18.555
[Mu-deok] What was that?

18:20.057 --> 18:23.519
Was it a relic that latched onto
the ice stone when it was in Jinyowon?

18:29.483 --> 18:31.819
[Beom] Hey, Mu-deok, what is this?

18:31.902 --> 18:34.571
This tea cup
for the Crown Prince has a chip in it.

18:34.655 --> 18:37.366
Oh, dear, I'm sorry. I will get another.

18:38.075 --> 18:41.411
[Mu-deok] Wait!
I do not need to be sorry anymore.

18:41.495 --> 18:42.955
- [Hyo] Mu-deok.
- Yes?

18:43.539 --> 18:45.958
The table is so dirty. Wipe it down.

18:46.041 --> 18:48.752
[Mu-deok] It is as if
being a servant is second nature.

18:48.836 --> 18:50.796
Have I completely become Mu-deok?

18:56.135 --> 18:57.761
I am not Mu-deok anymore.

18:57.845 --> 18:58.762
Mu-deok.

18:58.846 --> 19:00.722
- [tense music playing]
- Uh.

19:01.431 --> 19:02.766
[laughs awkwardly]

19:04.017 --> 19:06.937
We all haven't had much to eat today
because of the circumstances.

19:07.020 --> 19:08.438
Can you bring us something right now?

19:09.106 --> 19:11.733
Oh, you know,
that sujebi would be really nice.

19:11.817 --> 19:12.734
Okay?

19:19.491 --> 19:21.952
There is no Mu-deok after this sujebi.

19:22.744 --> 19:26.290
Once I am done making this,
there will be no more Mu-deok.

19:27.457 --> 19:29.710
As soon as I use the alchemy of souls
to leave this body,

19:29.793 --> 19:32.171
I can become anyone
who I would like to be.

19:34.423 --> 19:35.966
I can even be the King.

19:36.466 --> 19:38.719
[whimsical music playing]

19:39.636 --> 19:41.221
[laughs]

19:43.640 --> 19:45.184
Shall I kill my enemy

19:45.267 --> 19:47.060
and take over that body?

19:47.144 --> 19:49.521
[laughs]

19:51.732 --> 19:52.733
[exclaims]

19:55.652 --> 19:57.988
[groans] I don't want that.

19:58.071 --> 19:59.114
[inhales]

19:59.198 --> 20:00.908
Park Jin would be better.

20:01.533 --> 20:03.493
[fantasy music playing]

20:04.912 --> 20:06.288
[laughs]

20:08.040 --> 20:09.291
[hums]

20:09.374 --> 20:11.376
[chuckles]

20:11.460 --> 20:13.378
I can really be anyone I want.

20:13.962 --> 20:15.505
I guess I should think about it more.

20:17.007 --> 20:18.717
This is such a perfect dough.

20:18.800 --> 20:21.094
It's too good just for sujebi.

20:21.178 --> 20:22.763
Should I make noodles?

20:22.846 --> 20:24.431
Uk likes noodles much better.

20:25.557 --> 20:27.559
[tranquil music playing]

20:28.852 --> 20:29.686
[Master Lee] Hmm.

20:30.562 --> 20:32.648
There is a very faint taste of pheasant.

20:39.404 --> 20:43.325
I guess this will be the last meal
I prepare for Young Master.

20:53.293 --> 20:54.878
- Young Master.
- Oh.

20:56.255 --> 20:59.049
I made noodle soup. Go and have some.

20:59.132 --> 21:00.175
Yeah.

21:02.386 --> 21:03.220
[sighs]

21:04.096 --> 21:05.681
With that, the servant Mu-deok

21:06.431 --> 21:07.432
will be going now.

21:09.351 --> 21:10.269
And thus…

21:12.479 --> 21:14.564
the master and pupil relationship is done.

21:16.275 --> 21:17.317
It's done?

21:19.027 --> 21:21.071
You may not have noticed yet, but…

21:21.822 --> 21:23.448
we're inside the ice stone and…

21:24.157 --> 21:26.326
I regained my power
just like that time on the lake.

21:28.954 --> 21:30.789
I will soon perform the alchemy of souls

21:31.748 --> 21:33.375
and leave this body for good.

21:35.377 --> 21:36.670
So, you will leave now?

21:37.713 --> 21:39.381
And you'll never see me again?

21:39.464 --> 21:41.341
That was our promise from the beginning.

21:41.925 --> 21:43.885
Once I get all my powers back, I'm done.

21:43.969 --> 21:46.847
We both agreed
to make another promise then.

21:47.556 --> 21:49.641
[wistful music playing]

21:53.854 --> 21:55.355
Uk, there will be…

21:57.524 --> 21:58.775
no promises.

22:07.826 --> 22:09.870
[Mu-deok's soul] When something is gained,
something is lost.

22:09.953 --> 22:12.831
That is the burden of the person
who uses its power.

22:14.291 --> 22:16.501
If it is you I must lose to keep my power,

22:18.003 --> 22:19.421
then I'm going to bear it.

22:28.263 --> 22:29.139
[Jang Uk sighs]

22:30.182 --> 22:31.016
[clears throat]

22:31.683 --> 22:33.602
- Young Master.
- Yeah?

22:33.685 --> 22:35.771
I made noodle soup, so go and have some.

22:36.521 --> 22:38.065
- And--
- Mu-deok.

22:38.148 --> 22:40.233
The thing surrounding
Jeongjingak right now,

22:40.317 --> 22:42.194
I think it's very likely
to be the ice stone.

22:42.778 --> 22:43.612
[Mu-deok] What?

22:44.237 --> 22:46.073
He should not have realized that.

22:48.200 --> 22:50.494
The ice stone is said
to be water, fire, and wind.

22:51.036 --> 22:53.038
I think the barrier was formed
by its wind.

22:54.414 --> 22:56.124
If we are really inside of it,

22:56.917 --> 23:00.253
do you think that there is a way to take
this power without no one knowing?

23:03.048 --> 23:04.174
I'm not sure.

23:04.257 --> 23:05.884
I've already reached Chisu.

23:06.635 --> 23:08.470
Can I just catch it like the Golden Fish?

23:08.553 --> 23:10.931
No, your powers pale in comparison
to the ice stone.

23:11.598 --> 23:12.808
It is impossible.

23:12.891 --> 23:13.767
[sighs]

23:15.519 --> 23:18.396
I wish your power would return
just like at Lake Gyeongcheondaeho.

23:21.191 --> 23:22.526
You would be able to do it.

23:23.151 --> 23:25.195
[somber music playing]

23:25.737 --> 23:27.364
What if my powers return

23:28.115 --> 23:30.283
and Naksu decides to run away with them?

23:32.244 --> 23:34.788
You may have to face death
if you end up getting caught.

23:36.206 --> 23:37.124
Aren't you afraid?

23:37.999 --> 23:40.210
I mean I already have considered that.

23:40.293 --> 23:42.254
You may run away
once you regain your power.

23:43.171 --> 23:47.050
And I already told you before,
I was prepared to take responsibility.

23:52.097 --> 23:52.931
But…

23:54.015 --> 23:55.559
I guess I'm a little afraid

23:56.935 --> 24:01.815
that you might just abandon me without
my promise even crossing your mind.

24:03.483 --> 24:04.442
Master.

24:04.526 --> 24:08.238
Don't abandon me.
If you do, I will cry my eyes out. Hmm.

24:11.032 --> 24:14.619
You say such
embarrassing things sometimes.

24:15.996 --> 24:17.998
You'll regret it
when you think of it later.

24:20.333 --> 24:22.794
As long as you can bear
the embarrassment, you'll be fine.

24:23.336 --> 24:26.923
Regret is felt last minute,
and it's irreversible.

24:28.592 --> 24:31.303
Master, endure the embarrassment

24:31.386 --> 24:32.470
and try to be honest.

24:32.971 --> 24:35.891
Then, you will not feel regret
at the last moment.

24:41.730 --> 24:44.024
- Jang Uk, I--
- [Yun-ok] Young Master Jang.

24:47.652 --> 24:48.737
I'm coming now.

24:49.529 --> 24:51.573
She has the key
to the chamber with the banned books.

24:51.656 --> 24:54.326
While I'm stuck here,
I'll go ahead and do some research.

24:55.368 --> 24:56.453
Oh, Mu-deok.

25:02.292 --> 25:03.877
Eat it by yourself. Do not get caught.

25:05.003 --> 25:06.004
- Mm.
- [gasps softly]

25:07.422 --> 25:08.965
[soft music playing]

25:23.271 --> 25:24.105
[Jang Uk exhales]

25:29.736 --> 25:33.281
Are the books
you are looking for about sorcery, Uk?

25:33.365 --> 25:36.910
Yeah, I heard that the books
my father took from the shamans

25:36.993 --> 25:39.621
who practiced sorcery are here
somewhere in the study.

25:40.872 --> 25:42.332
I want to see what they were.

25:42.958 --> 25:43.792
Hmm.

25:45.418 --> 25:47.337
Lord Jang left these books behind.

25:48.505 --> 25:49.965
Let me help you find them.

25:50.048 --> 25:53.510
I will be fine here by myself.
So you can leave the key with me and go.

25:53.593 --> 25:55.136
[whimsical music playing]

25:55.220 --> 25:57.389
My grandfather left the key with me.

25:58.014 --> 25:59.432
How can I just leave it with you?

25:59.516 --> 26:01.893
Okay, I guess I'm not
the most trustworthy.

26:01.977 --> 26:03.520
You can stay and watch me, Yun-ok.

26:07.482 --> 26:09.067
[soft music playing]

26:15.615 --> 26:17.617
[indistinct chatter]

26:21.329 --> 26:23.248
Uh, everyone.

26:24.124 --> 26:27.836
There's enough space here
for everyone to sleep.

26:27.919 --> 26:30.547
And we have enough food, so don't worry.

26:31.381 --> 26:33.425
[Heo Yeom] Settle down for now, all right?

26:34.217 --> 26:35.260
Yeah.

26:43.685 --> 26:46.604
Return to Gisan immediately
and bring everyone else here.

26:46.688 --> 26:49.441
The ice stone is here.
We need to claim our share of its power.

26:49.524 --> 26:50.608
Understood!

26:53.737 --> 26:55.947
Gather everyone
who is able to cast spells.

26:56.031 --> 26:57.907
Even the elderly and children.

26:57.991 --> 26:59.242
[mage] Yes, lord.

26:59.326 --> 27:01.244
[suspenseful music playing]

27:07.167 --> 27:10.295
Call all of the mages
in Cheonbugwan to Songrim now.

27:10.378 --> 27:12.672
There could be a conflict
over the ice stone,

27:12.756 --> 27:14.924
so we need to be prepared, too.

27:15.008 --> 27:16.009
Yes.

27:23.975 --> 27:24.851
[queen] Your Majesty.

27:24.934 --> 27:26.770
I'm quite concerned for your well-being.

27:26.853 --> 27:28.855
Perhaps, you should get some rest.

27:28.938 --> 27:33.068
[inhales] I'm fine.
I need to see what happens.

27:33.777 --> 27:35.320
Since the ice stone appeared,

27:36.363 --> 27:38.281
the King's Star will also appear.

27:38.823 --> 27:40.867
[suspenseful music continues playing]

27:53.505 --> 27:56.841
Everyone must be waiting
for The Words of the Heart.

27:58.510 --> 27:59.803
Let's hurry in, then.

27:59.886 --> 28:00.720
Mm.

28:08.395 --> 28:09.437
Sang-ho.

28:09.521 --> 28:10.897
We brought back The Words of the Heart.

28:10.980 --> 28:12.816
That is not so important right now.

28:12.899 --> 28:14.692
A barrier has engulfed Jeongjingak.

28:15.276 --> 28:16.111
What?

28:22.117 --> 28:24.244
[brooding music playing]

28:24.327 --> 28:26.121
Will I be caught in the end?

28:28.289 --> 28:29.749
Then I will die.

28:39.384 --> 28:40.301
[sighs]

28:52.021 --> 28:53.148
It's a honey biscuit.

28:54.190 --> 28:55.817
It seems like you've had nothing to eat.

28:56.359 --> 28:57.652
You should eat.

29:01.614 --> 29:03.283
Thank you so much.

29:05.160 --> 29:08.246
You must have been surprised
to find out I am Jin Bu-yeon.

29:08.788 --> 29:11.750
When we met last time,
it was before I found my real parents.

29:13.126 --> 29:14.544
This is the umbrella you gave me.

29:16.171 --> 29:18.423
I've always kept it with me since then,

29:18.506 --> 29:20.717
in hopes you'd recognize me
if we met again.

29:24.012 --> 29:27.140
I heard that Jin Mu helped you
find your parents, is that right?

29:27.223 --> 29:28.224
Yeah.

29:30.185 --> 29:34.230
Don't ever let him know about how
we had met before, Young Master.

29:36.608 --> 29:38.109
I'm worried that it would

29:38.777 --> 29:41.237
break my mother's heart
if she heard what I've been through.

29:43.239 --> 29:45.116
Please, do not tell him.

29:46.618 --> 29:48.578
[Seo Yul] They killed everyone
she had encountered.

29:49.245 --> 29:50.538
Did she keep me a secret?

29:53.374 --> 29:56.461
[Jang Uk] Jin Mu is unaware that
we already know of

29:57.045 --> 29:58.713
So-i's true identity?

29:58.797 --> 30:02.425
Then he must have killed all those people
in order to hide it from everyone else.

30:02.509 --> 30:05.261
In the end, she will die, too.

30:05.887 --> 30:08.640
If their plan was to shift
the Queen's soul into that body,

30:09.224 --> 30:11.059
they intended to kill her from the start.

30:11.142 --> 30:13.311
She's trying her best without knowing
they will kill her anyway.

30:13.394 --> 30:14.896
Jin Mu is only using her.

30:16.272 --> 30:18.233
Just like he used Naksu before.

30:21.986 --> 30:24.113
It's a very unfortunate situation.

30:26.616 --> 30:27.534
Young Master.

30:28.368 --> 30:29.619
Did you know

30:29.702 --> 30:32.038
that this umbrella is
no longer useful as an umbrella?

30:34.040 --> 30:37.293
Look over here. There's a hole in it.
It has been ripped.

30:38.962 --> 30:40.046
That's a shame.

30:40.129 --> 30:42.382
I was told that it was very high-quality.

30:42.465 --> 30:44.259
They must have deceived you, then.

30:45.552 --> 30:47.136
[giggles]

30:50.473 --> 30:52.016
- I have always been easy to deceive.
- [laughs]

30:52.934 --> 30:54.185
Is that so?

31:16.875 --> 31:18.877
[ominous music playing]

31:34.559 --> 31:36.686
[Jin] What do you mean?
Master Kang has disappeared?

31:36.769 --> 31:40.064
Uh, he drained her energy
and then walked out.

31:40.732 --> 31:43.234
We've looked everywhere,
but we can not find him.

31:43.318 --> 31:46.362
He couldn't have gone
anywhere near the Training Center.

31:46.446 --> 31:47.655
The Unanimous Assembly is there.

31:47.739 --> 31:49.657
It was crowded there all day.

31:49.741 --> 31:51.451
He couldn't have moved undetected.

31:51.534 --> 31:54.787
There is still a place he could be hiding

31:55.455 --> 31:56.831
at this moment.

31:59.542 --> 32:01.252
In the barrier of Jeongjingak

32:02.462 --> 32:04.297
with all the young mages.

32:10.887 --> 32:12.889
[suspenseful music playing]

32:31.324 --> 32:32.158
[So-i gasps]

32:35.620 --> 32:36.579
[grunts]

32:42.335 --> 32:43.252
A soul shifter.

32:46.589 --> 32:48.007
I'm on Jin Mu's side.

32:52.929 --> 32:54.097
I know you.

32:54.764 --> 32:56.724
I saw your soul being shifted from a body

32:56.808 --> 32:59.102
of an old man into this body
that you have right now.

33:03.064 --> 33:05.274
[laughs]

33:09.821 --> 33:12.824
We're in this together. Please, spare me.

33:15.410 --> 33:17.412
I need human energy immediately.

33:17.495 --> 33:19.122
I can definitely bring you someone.

33:19.205 --> 33:20.999
Surely, the energy of a mage
from Jeongjingak

33:21.082 --> 33:23.584
would be better than
taking energy from me alone.

33:24.210 --> 33:25.753
Stay hidden here,

33:25.837 --> 33:27.797
and I will bring someone to you, okay?

33:29.507 --> 33:31.592
- Jeongjingak's mages?
- Yes.

33:31.676 --> 33:33.344
There is a barrier
around this place right now,

33:33.428 --> 33:35.722
so I'm sure nobody can leave or enter.

33:36.347 --> 33:38.099
There's a barrier surrounding us?

33:38.683 --> 33:39.976
[breathes heavily]

33:40.059 --> 33:41.185
[door opens]

33:53.656 --> 33:55.033
Young Lady Jin?

33:55.616 --> 33:56.826
What are you doing here?

33:57.368 --> 33:58.828
I was looking for something,

33:59.370 --> 34:01.914
but I have lost my umbrella
that I use as a cane.

34:02.874 --> 34:04.542
Oh, it's right here.

34:13.593 --> 34:14.469
[grunts]

34:15.428 --> 34:16.262
[gasps]

34:17.388 --> 34:18.556
[mage grunting]

34:26.397 --> 34:27.815
[So-i gasping]

34:41.245 --> 34:45.124
I will spare your life.
Now go, bring me more.

34:45.708 --> 34:46.542
Okay.

34:47.043 --> 34:48.169
[So-i breathes heavily]

34:50.505 --> 34:51.964
Of the mages here,

34:52.673 --> 34:54.133
is Seo Yul among them?

34:56.969 --> 34:57.804
Why?

34:59.347 --> 35:00.681
[young mage groans]

35:01.307 --> 35:02.934
[young mage] He cut me.

35:03.518 --> 35:05.103
So I'm going to kill him first.

35:06.437 --> 35:07.480
Seo Yul…

35:08.481 --> 35:09.649
is not here right now.

35:13.111 --> 35:14.362
Bring him to me…

35:16.197 --> 35:17.532
or I will kill you instead.

35:17.615 --> 35:18.491
I'll bring him.

35:20.201 --> 35:22.745
I also have someone here
I really need to get rid of.

35:24.163 --> 35:25.623
I will bring her here, then.

35:27.333 --> 35:29.001
So you can kill her first.

35:42.890 --> 35:45.184
How come your cooking is so bad, Mu-deok?

35:45.268 --> 35:46.477
Where did you learn to do this?

35:48.020 --> 35:49.772
[Mu-deok] Since I have not told Uk yet,

35:50.356 --> 35:52.108
I'll be Mu-deok just a bit longer.

35:53.151 --> 35:54.819
My apologies, Your Highness.

35:55.945 --> 35:57.864
This is the leader's wine
that Dang-gu hid away.

36:05.621 --> 36:06.956
How is it?

36:08.249 --> 36:09.792
It's pretty good. I like it.

36:10.376 --> 36:12.044
[Go Won] What are they doing out there?

36:12.128 --> 36:14.672
- Why haven't they taken down this thing?
- [Hyo] Still,

36:14.755 --> 36:16.924
within the barrier,
the flowers are blooming,

36:17.008 --> 36:18.217
the weather is nice,

36:18.301 --> 36:20.970
the air is filled with energy.
It's not too bad, is it?

36:22.221 --> 36:24.891
[Beom] Royal Highness,
you must be bored looking at flowers.

36:24.974 --> 36:26.934
Would you like to see
my family's Hyeongong?

36:27.643 --> 36:30.146
Cha Beom's Hyeongong
is quite a sight to behold.

36:30.229 --> 36:31.147
Yeah?

36:32.064 --> 36:33.191
All right, let me see it, then.

36:33.774 --> 36:34.609
[Beom] Of course.

36:35.735 --> 36:37.737
[thrilling music playing]

36:49.207 --> 36:50.541
[sword clinks]

36:56.047 --> 36:57.506
[grunts]

37:04.805 --> 37:06.098
[pants]

37:10.186 --> 37:11.354
[grunts]

37:20.863 --> 37:21.906
[Hyo] What?

37:21.989 --> 37:23.866
- Beom!
- Beom! Beom!

37:24.909 --> 37:26.410
[Yeol] Beom, wake up.

37:26.494 --> 37:28.412
- Huh?
- [Hyo] What? What just happened?

37:28.496 --> 37:29.830
Beom! Beom!

37:30.498 --> 37:31.332
[sighs]

37:32.458 --> 37:34.543
Are you saying you lost
your energy when you used the spell?

37:34.627 --> 37:35.461
[Beom] Yes.

37:35.544 --> 37:37.755
The whole time,
I felt like my energy was being drained.

37:37.838 --> 37:38.923
But it seems…
[breathes heavily]

37:40.132 --> 37:42.301
…my energy has drained as water would.

37:43.177 --> 37:44.720
When I checked his energy,

37:44.804 --> 37:46.555
it was indeed empty.

37:46.639 --> 37:47.473
[Beom sighs]

37:48.349 --> 37:49.850
How did I lose my energy?

37:50.810 --> 37:52.186
[Beom sobs]

38:00.403 --> 38:01.779
Maybe it's the sword.

38:05.491 --> 38:07.451
[suspenseful music playing]

38:19.755 --> 38:22.174
The energy I gathered
in the sword just spilled out.

38:22.758 --> 38:24.760
It seems like it is the barrier
rather than the sword.

38:26.804 --> 38:29.390
I think this barrier takes the energy…

38:30.975 --> 38:32.518
that is used to cast a spell.

38:33.602 --> 38:35.730
[suspenseful music continues playing]

38:46.532 --> 38:48.326
Within the barrier,
there will be no spells,

38:48.409 --> 38:50.036
and, of course, no swords, either.

38:50.828 --> 38:52.413
Let's leave them right here,
just to be safe.

38:59.503 --> 39:00.421
[Go Won] Hmm.

39:01.130 --> 39:03.632
That's the assassin's sword
Master Lee took from me a while ago.

39:04.175 --> 39:05.301
He gave it to you, then?

39:05.384 --> 39:07.970
Yes, he told me to hold on to this sword.

39:08.054 --> 39:09.847
But Maidservant Kim
didn't like it at home,

39:09.930 --> 39:11.182
so I've been keeping it here.

39:12.350 --> 39:14.393
[pensive music playing]

39:19.273 --> 39:20.107
[sighs]

39:26.030 --> 39:27.365
[Master Lee] Keep this with you and…

39:27.948 --> 39:29.617
pass it on to him if he comes here.

39:31.577 --> 39:34.163
I can't really leave
and give it to someone else.

39:35.289 --> 39:36.499
[Lee] Maidservant Kim.

39:37.625 --> 39:38.459
Yes.

39:38.959 --> 39:41.003
Has the Assembly ended
without any problems?

39:41.504 --> 39:42.838
Gosh! No! Far from it.

39:42.922 --> 39:46.175
Right now, mages from every region
are all flocking together to Songrim.

39:47.635 --> 39:49.053
It seems like something has happened.

39:50.471 --> 39:53.641
[Master Lee] With all this commotion,
I imagine he will come.

40:01.232 --> 40:03.567
Is Gwanju Jang Gang really
going to come back here?

40:08.364 --> 40:10.408
[eerie music playing]

40:28.092 --> 40:30.136
Who are you to come to
Cheonbugwan like this?

40:33.222 --> 40:34.765
Gwanju, you're here!

40:39.395 --> 40:42.064
Who is the right-hand man
of the Assistant Gwanju

40:42.148 --> 40:43.482
of Cheonbugwan, Jin Mu?

40:44.191 --> 40:46.193
[suspenseful music playing]

41:08.591 --> 41:11.760
Cho Chung threatened me
saying he'd reveal Uk's birth.

41:11.844 --> 41:15.055
That's why I taught him
the alchemy of souls.

41:15.639 --> 41:18.934
Now that he is dead,
is there anything to worry about?

41:19.852 --> 41:22.855
Everything I did was for you
and the young master.

41:24.106 --> 41:27.610
I have lost both my closest friend
and my wife because of sorcery.

41:28.110 --> 41:29.111
[inhales deeply]

41:29.195 --> 41:31.155
I will dispose of the soul ejector,

41:31.906 --> 41:34.158
and seal the ice stone away
in Lake Gyeongcheondaeho.

41:34.783 --> 41:35.784
You cannot.

41:36.869 --> 41:39.455
You have gone through so much
to master this spell.

41:39.538 --> 41:40.915
How could you give up the ice stone?

41:41.540 --> 41:42.374
You cannot.

41:44.210 --> 41:46.170
Since you also mastered
the alchemy of souls,

41:47.129 --> 41:49.965
I must block your energy flow
so you cannot perform sorcery.

41:50.049 --> 41:51.300
Block my energy flow?

41:52.718 --> 41:54.178
[stammers] You cannot.

42:00.226 --> 42:01.143
[Jin Mu gasps]

42:01.227 --> 42:03.479
Please, don't! I, Jin Mu,

42:04.104 --> 42:08.734
your pupil, promise I'll never perform
the alchemy of souls that you taught me.

42:08.817 --> 42:10.861
My Master, I swear!

42:29.588 --> 42:31.840
[Gang] I should have cut off
his energy flow then.

42:34.802 --> 42:36.136
I shouldn't have hidden the ice stone,

42:36.220 --> 42:38.347
but instead, let everyone know
of my wrongdoings,

42:38.931 --> 42:40.391
and destroyed it at Songrim.

42:43.185 --> 42:45.271
How did Jin Mu find the ice stone…

42:47.273 --> 42:49.233
that I sealed in Lake Gyeoncheondaeho?

42:50.317 --> 42:51.819
Did someone find it for him?

43:00.995 --> 43:02.997
[soft music playing]

43:23.684 --> 43:25.436
I feel completely fine.

43:27.271 --> 43:29.440
There is only one difference between us.

43:30.941 --> 43:31.859
That is…

43:34.445 --> 43:35.738
I am a soul shifter.

43:39.325 --> 43:40.701
- [Hyo] Hey, Beom.
- Huh?

43:41.535 --> 43:43.495
- You can just train hard again.
- [Yeol laughs awkwardly]

43:43.579 --> 43:46.165
[Yeol] Yeah, exactly.
It's going to be fine.

43:46.248 --> 43:47.458
[mage] Yes, come on, cheer up.
[laughs]

43:47.541 --> 43:50.628
[Mu-deok] The ice stone is taking
all of their energy.

43:50.711 --> 43:53.672
If I shift my soul
and take the energy of the ice stone,

43:54.256 --> 43:56.925
does that mean
I will take all of their energy, too?

43:57.426 --> 43:59.428
[Mu-deok's soul] When something is gained,
something is lost.

44:00.095 --> 44:02.848
That is the burden of the person
who uses its power.

44:03.891 --> 44:05.726
So for me to take the power…

44:07.853 --> 44:10.147
I have to take
all of their powers as well.

44:11.523 --> 44:12.358
Then,

44:13.025 --> 44:14.360
they will probably die.

44:15.944 --> 44:17.863
[somber music playing]

44:25.829 --> 44:27.289
She meant I'd have to bear

44:28.165 --> 44:30.042
the deaths of all those people, too.

44:33.796 --> 44:36.090
[Go Won] Filthy Mu-deok,
what are you doing here?

44:42.805 --> 44:44.139
[Mu-deok] He will die, too.

44:45.140 --> 44:45.974
[Go Won] It's dangerous.

44:46.558 --> 44:48.102
If you touch the barrier by accident,

44:48.686 --> 44:50.646
someone like you
could get seriously injured.

44:50.729 --> 44:51.814
Get away from it!

44:56.402 --> 44:58.112
Are you not going to say,
"Thank you, sire"?

44:59.947 --> 45:02.241
Have I not worried
quite a bit for you just now?

45:05.285 --> 45:07.204
You had your energy taken earlier.

45:08.330 --> 45:09.540
Do you feel okay?

45:11.708 --> 45:14.169
Are you returning my worry
by worrying about me?

45:15.254 --> 45:16.380
All right, that's fair.

45:17.506 --> 45:19.258
Well, I seem to be okay, though.

45:20.426 --> 45:21.593
I'm very sorry.

45:21.677 --> 45:22.511
For what?

45:23.011 --> 45:26.515
You couldn't eat anything
since my noodle soup

45:27.057 --> 45:28.725
and everything I cooked wasn't good.

45:34.440 --> 45:35.941
Have this at least.

45:40.362 --> 45:41.822
It's Jang Uk's favorite biscuit.

45:42.489 --> 45:44.867
Are you sharing the snack
you kept to give your master?

45:44.950 --> 45:47.453
I'm fine. You eat it.
[scoffs]

45:49.371 --> 45:52.332
Remember!
I should have taken those biscuits…

45:53.876 --> 45:55.919
but chose to leave them for you.

45:56.753 --> 45:57.671
I'm giving…

46:00.632 --> 46:02.259
all of them to you, all right.

46:03.802 --> 46:06.889
[Mu-deok] Even though he's selfish,
he has given me a lot.

46:10.476 --> 46:11.351
Please, take one.

46:11.435 --> 46:13.562
I'm giving it to you
in all sincerity, too.

46:14.938 --> 46:16.899
- You're sincere?
- Yes.

46:17.566 --> 46:18.567
I am sincere.

46:20.402 --> 46:22.237
Thank you for everything, sire.

46:27.534 --> 46:29.161
No, thanks. If you're gonna
give something,

46:30.120 --> 46:32.915
give me something bigger, okay?
Next time, instead.

46:34.791 --> 46:36.210
I like gifts that are bigger.

46:43.634 --> 46:44.927
Please, just take it.

46:46.428 --> 46:48.138
It is just the right amount for you.

46:52.226 --> 46:54.061
Filthy Mu-deok, you really are…

46:56.230 --> 46:59.149
You always come so ridiculously close
that it is almost rude,

46:59.733 --> 47:02.319
but if I try to catch you,
you move away again.

47:05.697 --> 47:07.282
The reason I don't want to try…

47:09.117 --> 47:11.328
is because if I can't catch you
when I am trying hard…

47:14.456 --> 47:15.290
[sighs]

47:16.792 --> 47:19.545
Never mind. I will not accept that much.

47:25.217 --> 47:26.051
[sighs]

47:33.016 --> 47:35.769
I would have felt less sorry
if he had taken it from me.

47:39.773 --> 47:40.607
[Mu-deok] That's right.

47:41.692 --> 47:44.152
This is just the right amount
I should feel sorry for.

47:46.280 --> 47:47.781
[soft chime]

48:08.468 --> 48:09.303
[So-i] Mu-deok.

48:12.180 --> 48:13.640
I have a favor to ask.

48:14.349 --> 48:16.602
Could you go to the mages' residence hall?

48:17.936 --> 48:19.062
What for?

48:19.146 --> 48:22.149
The air is so humid.
Could you get me a new blanket?

48:23.066 --> 48:24.651
I was told they're in there.

48:29.239 --> 48:31.241
[suspenseful music playing]

48:38.832 --> 48:40.042
All right, then.

49:00.187 --> 49:01.396
What are you doing?

49:01.938 --> 49:04.066
The fire is dying,
so I am trying to bring it back.

49:08.528 --> 49:09.571
[Seo Yul blows]

49:12.616 --> 49:14.034
[gasps]

49:14.117 --> 49:15.118
[both yelp]

49:16.453 --> 49:18.038
[whimsical music playing]

49:19.831 --> 49:21.750
[both cough]

49:23.001 --> 49:24.836
- [Mu-deok] Goodness.
- [coughs]

49:24.920 --> 49:26.213
Ugh, seriously?

49:26.797 --> 49:28.048
Are you stupid?

49:29.800 --> 49:31.468
- Argh.
- Hold on.

49:35.013 --> 49:37.808
Did you really just say that I was stupid?

49:37.891 --> 49:39.559
There are so many books in this study,

49:39.643 --> 49:41.228
and you could have almost burned them all.

49:41.311 --> 49:43.271
I could have controlled that using spells,

49:43.355 --> 49:44.773
but I can't use them now.

49:46.024 --> 49:47.275
So I was flustered.

49:47.359 --> 49:50.278
Even if you can't,
you could have still put a lid on it.

49:50.862 --> 49:52.572
I heard you were a prodigy,

49:52.656 --> 49:54.574
but you don't know how to use a lid
when you get confused.

49:54.658 --> 49:57.035
- You're just thick-headed.
- Don't insult me.

49:57.119 --> 49:58.662
It will make me angry.

49:58.745 --> 49:59.579
[scoffs]

50:00.497 --> 50:01.998
So you do get angry?

50:03.375 --> 50:05.961
You used to always be calm
like lukewarm water.

50:06.044 --> 50:08.797
Even lukewarm water can boil
and freeze, too.

50:09.673 --> 50:11.174
It's not always the same.

50:16.346 --> 50:17.180
[Mu-deok sighs]

50:19.433 --> 50:21.852
It's very humid because of the fog.

50:21.935 --> 50:23.895
Is that why your injured leg is aching?

50:25.522 --> 50:26.773
[soft music playing]

50:26.857 --> 50:29.401
You… remembered my injury.

50:30.360 --> 50:32.779
[laughs softly] I'm fine. Do not worry.

50:35.866 --> 50:36.700
[laughs softly]

50:37.284 --> 50:39.494
You said you liked pine pollen tea snacks.

50:41.663 --> 50:43.165
I never got to make you any.

50:44.207 --> 50:45.709
You remembered that as well.

50:47.544 --> 50:49.087
Does it matter if I remembered

50:49.796 --> 50:51.548
if I have not done anything for you?

50:52.424 --> 50:54.468
Then, make it for me next time.

50:57.721 --> 50:58.889
[Mu-deok] There is no next time.

50:59.389 --> 51:02.809
If I shift my soul, he will die here, too.

51:03.602 --> 51:04.478
[Seo Yul] No, wait.

51:04.561 --> 51:06.855
If you teach me how to make tea snacks,

51:06.938 --> 51:09.900
I can make them, too, like last time.

51:10.567 --> 51:11.401
You remember?

51:18.158 --> 51:19.034
[sighs]

51:19.117 --> 51:19.951
All…

51:21.036 --> 51:23.121
my memories of Danhyanggok are wonderful.

51:32.839 --> 51:35.759
[Mu-deok] Seo Yul… is going to die.

51:38.053 --> 51:38.887
[clears throat]

51:40.639 --> 51:43.600
I was on my way to the residence hall
to get a blanket.

51:43.683 --> 51:44.518
I should go.

51:53.151 --> 51:56.029
I will go to the residence hall,
so you go find Uk.

51:56.112 --> 51:58.448
[somber music playing]

52:05.580 --> 52:07.123
I know he's been looking for you.

52:20.011 --> 52:22.013
[Mu-deok] I have to go back
to being Naksu.

52:22.889 --> 52:24.766
Then I can cut off Seo Yul for good.

52:27.227 --> 52:29.229
I have to cut ties with everyone.

52:34.109 --> 52:34.943
[sighs]

52:42.242 --> 52:44.244
[Go Won] Glaring at the barrier
will not break it.

52:51.710 --> 52:52.752
You see that?

52:53.628 --> 52:54.796
The rock went right through.

52:56.047 --> 52:56.882
It did.

52:58.008 --> 53:00.176
Can objects without water
pass through the barrier?

53:00.260 --> 53:01.344
[Go Won] What an odd barrier!

53:01.887 --> 53:04.764
Some things can go through,
but other things cannot.

53:04.848 --> 53:06.224
Are there barriers like that?

53:07.017 --> 53:08.685
What are they doing out there?

53:08.768 --> 53:12.522
With all those mages gathered
around there, they can't break it through?

53:13.940 --> 53:15.692
Is it because
it's the ice stone that made it?

53:15.775 --> 53:19.613
They are probably just too busy fighting
over the ice stone to even try anything.

53:19.696 --> 53:23.408
How can that be more important?
I am here, you know!

53:24.451 --> 53:29.205
It seems you are not as important
to Her Majesty as the ice stone.

53:30.749 --> 53:32.125
What mother acts like that?

53:33.209 --> 53:35.045
She acts exactly like my father.

53:35.670 --> 53:36.504
[inhales deeply]

53:37.213 --> 53:38.048
Indeed.

53:38.798 --> 53:42.469
Everyone already knows,
the queen is not my real mother.

53:43.637 --> 53:45.472
Just like Jang Gang isn't your father.

53:47.641 --> 53:49.142
That is what they all say around here.

53:49.976 --> 53:51.895
I don't care if it hurts
your feelings or not.

53:52.604 --> 53:54.481
I'll also get straight to the point, sire.

53:55.190 --> 53:58.902
Will you be able to kill
the Queen and Jin Mu even if they

53:58.985 --> 54:00.362
offer the ice stone to you?

54:03.782 --> 54:07.661
If such a great power comes to me,
it may be hard to give that up. Yes.

54:08.745 --> 54:09.829
You're very brave.

54:11.331 --> 54:13.959
Being open about your own desires
requires courage, sire.

54:18.296 --> 54:19.381
Then what about you?

54:19.881 --> 54:21.800
What will you do
if you actually get the ice stone?

54:25.303 --> 54:27.180
I'll do as Master Seo Gyeong did.

54:27.263 --> 54:28.431
Seo Gyeong?

54:30.016 --> 54:32.852
Do you mean you wish to become
a hero with the fate of the King's Star

54:32.936 --> 54:34.771
by destroying every ice stone, then?

54:34.854 --> 54:38.441
I think that purpose was
also his true intention.

54:40.944 --> 54:43.405
But so is hiding one of the ice stones

54:43.488 --> 54:45.115
to save someone precious to him.

54:45.615 --> 54:48.076
Well, I… [smacks lips]
…prefer that story, anyway.

54:51.413 --> 54:53.331
You said that is what written
in The Words of the Heart?

54:53.999 --> 54:57.293
In the end, it's just a cowardly excuse
as to why he could not give up the power.

54:58.086 --> 54:59.379
Who would actually believe that?

54:59.462 --> 55:00.839
Oh, I can believe it.

55:02.799 --> 55:05.468
I would have done the same thing.

55:22.986 --> 55:24.112
What?

55:24.195 --> 55:26.031
Rocks can pass through, right?

55:26.114 --> 55:28.616
Write a letter telling them to save you
and throw it through the barrier.

55:31.828 --> 55:32.662
Jang Uk.

55:34.122 --> 55:35.248
You're a genius.

55:36.291 --> 55:38.293
[whimsical music playing]

55:41.296 --> 55:42.297
[Jang Uk grunts]

55:43.673 --> 55:45.842
- Dumb barrier!
- [Go Won] Hey, Uk.

55:46.593 --> 55:48.428
Is there a bigger rock?

55:48.511 --> 55:50.305
[Jang Uk] You just need to
tell them to rescue you.

55:50.388 --> 55:52.098
Why do you need a bigger one?

55:52.182 --> 55:53.600
[Go Won] We need to write it big.

55:54.392 --> 55:56.519
Hey, is this… is this rock embedded here?

55:59.439 --> 56:00.523
[all mages] Cheers.

56:01.691 --> 56:05.445
[Yeol] I mean, I don't understand,
how could Dang-gu hide this wine here

56:05.528 --> 56:06.696
and not tell us about it?

56:06.780 --> 56:09.240
[Hyo] I know.
We should drink it all. Go on!

56:09.324 --> 56:11.326
- [Yeol] Let us drink. Let us drink.
- [mage] Come on guys! Drink up!

56:16.498 --> 56:17.874
Here's the brazier.

56:20.335 --> 56:21.461
Mu-deok.

56:22.045 --> 56:23.838
Why are you here?

56:23.922 --> 56:25.006
What do you mean?

56:26.007 --> 56:29.594
Ah, Young Master Seo Yul went
to go fetch the blankets instead.

56:30.386 --> 56:31.221
[gasps]

56:32.847 --> 56:34.641
[breathes shakily]

56:34.724 --> 56:36.601
So I'm going to kill him first.

56:39.020 --> 56:40.355
[breathes heavily]

56:40.438 --> 56:42.690
[suspenseful music playing]

56:45.235 --> 56:46.319
[door opens]

56:49.948 --> 56:51.366
[pants]

57:07.090 --> 57:09.592
Young Master Seo,
you must not go in there.

57:10.844 --> 57:13.096
- What's going on?
- Please, turn back.

57:14.889 --> 57:17.308
Can you see me right now?

57:17.392 --> 57:19.477
Uh, about that…

57:27.360 --> 57:28.736
[gasps]

57:28.820 --> 57:30.780
[tense music playing]

57:35.493 --> 57:36.661
- [young mage yells]
- [So-i screams]

57:37.579 --> 57:38.413
[grunts]

57:50.383 --> 57:51.926
Young Master!

57:52.010 --> 57:53.761
[So-i screams]

58:06.232 --> 58:07.484
[grunts]

58:07.567 --> 58:08.985
[laughs, yelps]

58:12.947 --> 58:13.781
[gasps]

58:17.911 --> 58:18.745
[grunts]

58:20.747 --> 58:21.748
[So-i screams]

58:22.373 --> 58:23.666
- [So-i] Young Master!
- [groans]

58:25.543 --> 58:28.671
- Young Master! Oh, no! Young Master!
- [groans]

58:28.755 --> 58:30.673
[So-i wailing]

58:42.936 --> 58:44.938
[suspenseful music playing]

58:46.940 --> 58:47.815
Young Master!

58:51.110 --> 58:52.820
[shouts]

58:54.822 --> 58:55.657
[grunts]

59:04.207 --> 59:06.292
[shouts]

59:12.423 --> 59:13.258
[Beom] What?

59:13.800 --> 59:15.677
[stammers] Who are you?

59:27.272 --> 59:28.314
[young mage grunts]

59:41.160 --> 59:41.995
[shouts]

59:42.787 --> 59:43.621
[grunts in pain]

59:44.497 --> 59:46.833
[Yeol] Yul! Yul! Yul!

59:49.419 --> 59:50.920
[all shout]

59:53.298 --> 59:55.258
- [So-i] Young Master!
- [Yun-ok] Are you all right?

01:00:01.556 --> 01:00:02.390
[grunts]

01:00:02.932 --> 01:00:03.891
[mages yell]

01:00:11.691 --> 01:00:12.650
[mage groans]

01:00:18.740 --> 01:00:20.450
[energy whooshing]

01:00:27.457 --> 01:00:28.291
Yul.

01:00:30.251 --> 01:00:32.045
- What happened?
- [Yeol] A soul shifter.

01:00:32.128 --> 01:00:33.296
There's a soul shifter.

01:00:33.379 --> 01:00:34.631
- What?
- [door opens]

01:00:34.714 --> 01:00:35.840
[Beom pants]

01:00:38.134 --> 01:00:38.968
There's a soul shifter.

01:00:39.552 --> 01:00:42.180
A soul shifter has consumed
Yun-su and Jin-ho's energy.

01:00:57.820 --> 01:01:00.990
The soul shifter is Master Kang.
He is a very strong mage.

01:01:01.074 --> 01:01:04.410
To make matters worse,
he's using energy to cast spells.

01:01:04.494 --> 01:01:06.704
It's impossible.
No one can cast spells in this place.

01:01:07.413 --> 01:01:08.831
How could a soul shifter do it?

01:01:08.915 --> 01:01:12.835
Even though we lose our energy here,
I think it is the opposite for them.

01:01:15.797 --> 01:01:17.632
[Mu-deok] What if my powers return

01:01:18.257 --> 01:01:20.426
and Naksu decides to run away with them?

01:01:21.094 --> 01:01:23.846
You may have to face death
if you end up getting caught.

01:01:25.306 --> 01:01:26.516
Aren't you afraid?

01:01:26.599 --> 01:01:28.685
I guess I'm a little afraid

01:01:28.768 --> 01:01:33.189
that you might just abandon me without
my promise even crossing your mind.

01:01:35.608 --> 01:01:38.277
- Jang Uk, I--
- [Yun-ok] Young Master Jang.

01:01:42.365 --> 01:01:45.326
Where is Mu-deok?
Mu-deok, where is she, huh?

01:01:45.910 --> 01:01:47.704
She was with us earlier.

01:01:48.329 --> 01:01:49.288
[Beom] Where did she go?

01:01:56.295 --> 01:01:58.089
So there was something in my way.

01:02:08.641 --> 01:02:10.435
They will all die at this rate.

01:02:13.020 --> 01:02:15.898
When I shift my soul,
they'll all perish, anyway.

01:02:15.982 --> 01:02:17.900
It doesn't make any sense to help them.

01:02:17.984 --> 01:02:18.943
[inhales deeply]

01:02:19.026 --> 01:02:20.903
It will be the best way to cut ties.

01:02:25.742 --> 01:02:27.452
This is the very last time

01:02:28.536 --> 01:02:31.289
I will help them. After this, though,

01:02:32.206 --> 01:02:33.249
never again.

01:02:35.835 --> 01:02:36.669
[Beom] Mu-deok.

01:02:38.212 --> 01:02:40.631
- Where have you been?
- I'm here, aren't I?

01:02:41.424 --> 01:02:42.258
Uk has…

01:02:43.134 --> 01:02:44.343
Uk is going to die.

01:02:44.427 --> 01:02:46.053
[eerie music playing]

01:02:50.850 --> 01:02:51.893
[footsteps approaching]

01:02:52.935 --> 01:02:54.937
[suspenseful music playing]

01:03:05.823 --> 01:03:07.450
[Jang Uk] No one can beat him in here.

01:03:08.284 --> 01:03:09.410
We can't all die.

01:03:09.994 --> 01:03:12.413
So I'll lure him into
the Secret Room and lock him up.

01:03:16.125 --> 01:03:19.128
[Beom] If Uk is trapped
in the Secret Room with that soul shifter,

01:03:19.212 --> 01:03:20.546
he's going to die.

01:03:21.088 --> 01:03:22.048
- Why?
- [sobbing]

01:03:22.965 --> 01:03:24.801
Why did my young master go alone?

01:03:25.426 --> 01:03:27.261
He said it had to be him,

01:03:27.887 --> 01:03:29.305
that it was his responsibility.

01:03:29.388 --> 01:03:30.681
[sobbing continues]

01:03:36.687 --> 01:03:39.273
- Where do you think you are going?
- I need to check that room.

01:03:40.650 --> 01:03:42.568
If the door is not actually closed,

01:03:44.070 --> 01:03:46.614
that means he died
before luring the soul shifter.

01:03:46.697 --> 01:03:48.199
And if the door is locked,

01:03:49.116 --> 01:03:50.576
that means he died inside.

01:03:51.494 --> 01:03:52.620
There's nothing you can do.

01:03:55.164 --> 01:03:57.250
You said you would not try to catch me.

01:03:58.835 --> 01:04:00.294
You cannot stop me.

01:04:01.587 --> 01:04:02.672
Let me go.

01:04:03.422 --> 01:04:05.424
[somber music playing]

01:05:01.147 --> 01:05:04.650
[Go Won] And if the door is locked,
that means he died inside.

01:05:09.530 --> 01:05:12.950
[Jang Uk] Regret is felt last minute,
and it's irreversible.

01:05:14.535 --> 01:05:15.411
Jang Uk.

01:05:17.204 --> 01:05:18.456
[whimpers]

01:05:35.765 --> 01:05:37.600
[loud rumbling]

01:05:40.853 --> 01:05:42.855
[intense music playing]

01:06:15.763 --> 01:06:17.765
[intense music continues playing]

01:06:55.928 --> 01:06:56.971
[groans]

01:07:07.106 --> 01:07:09.108
[somber music playing]

01:07:17.867 --> 01:07:18.743
[sobbing]

01:07:49.315 --> 01:07:50.524
[sobbing continues]

01:07:55.071 --> 01:07:57.114
[soft footsteps approaching]

01:08:09.627 --> 01:08:11.045
You are alive…

01:08:13.214 --> 01:08:14.548
my dear pupil.

01:08:33.901 --> 01:08:35.528
Why did you hide your power?

01:08:39.698 --> 01:08:40.574
So…

01:08:42.827 --> 01:08:44.078
you would die, too.

01:08:45.913 --> 01:08:46.831
Then why…

01:08:48.290 --> 01:08:49.250
did you come?

01:08:52.920 --> 01:08:53.921
Because…

01:08:56.715 --> 01:08:57.550
[inhales deeply]

01:08:58.259 --> 01:08:59.718
…I was afraid you'd die.

01:09:06.433 --> 01:09:08.144
Now that you've drawn your sword…

01:09:09.562 --> 01:09:10.855
you must decide.

01:09:14.108 --> 01:09:15.609
I know you've been avoiding it.

01:09:15.693 --> 01:09:18.320
And I know that
your decision could kill all of us.

01:09:22.867 --> 01:09:24.076
As we promised,

01:09:25.161 --> 01:09:26.871
point your sword at me first.

01:09:27.580 --> 01:09:28.414
[gasps]

01:09:28.914 --> 01:09:30.916
[somber music playing]

01:09:40.759 --> 01:09:42.178
[Jang Uk] You stab me,

01:09:42.261 --> 01:09:44.972
and I'll take responsibility
for setting Naksu upon the world,

01:09:46.056 --> 01:09:46.932
and I will die.

01:09:49.768 --> 01:09:50.603
If you don't…

01:09:51.896 --> 01:09:53.689
well, at that time,
I will make you another promise.

01:10:17.296 --> 01:10:18.130
Now…

01:10:22.927 --> 01:10:24.595
make your next promise…

01:10:26.347 --> 01:10:28.182
to me right now, Young Master.

01:10:37.149 --> 01:10:39.151
[soft music playing]

01:11:41.505 --> 01:11:44.800
What human being would be able
to refuse such a great power?

01:11:44.883 --> 01:11:47.177
In order to protect
what must be protected.

01:11:47.261 --> 01:11:48.679
What if I gave it everything?

01:11:48.762 --> 01:11:50.556
I'm trying to do the same.

01:11:51.223 --> 01:11:53.142
What is he doing here?

01:11:53.225 --> 01:11:55.728
[Jin Mu]
Jin Bu-yeon's immense divine powers

01:11:55.811 --> 01:11:57.896
did not only come from
her mother of the Jin family.

01:11:57.980 --> 01:12:01.859
[queen] Park Jin! You knew everything
and decided to hide it.

01:12:01.942 --> 01:12:03.110
[screams]

01:12:03.193 --> 01:12:05.571
[Master Lee] When it does,
those who must go will go,

01:12:05.654 --> 01:12:07.698
 and those who must return will return.

01:12:07.781 --> 01:12:10.367
Young Master, do what you must do.

01:12:10.451 --> 01:12:12.036
[Jang Uk] It's spirit
instead of being full of it.

01:12:12.119 --> 01:12:15.205
I'm going to do just that.
Just as my master taught me to.

01:12:15.289 --> 01:12:17.624
- [Mu-deok] …look that pretty?
- Wow!

01:12:17.708 --> 01:12:19.585
[Jang Uk] I heard there was a bride
getting married soon.
